            <ArticleTitle>Tendinopathies of the elbow, wrist, and hand: histopathology and clinical considerations.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>191-200; quiz 201</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.jht.2011.12.001</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article reviews the current opinion of the histopathological findings of common elbow, wrist, and hand tendinopathies. Implications for client management including examination, diagnosis, prognosis, intervention, and outcomes are addressed. Concepts for further research regarding common therapeutic interventions are discussed.</AbstractText>
